    <briefdescription>
<para>Default three-way comparator for scalar-like types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>negative when lhs &lt; rhs</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>zero when lhs == rhs</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>positive when lhs &gt; rhs</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>This matches the comparator style used in the C AVL implementation. </para>
